ple our goal is to  ensure enough food reserves for as long  as the lockdown continues we are also  working on improving health facilities  but for a country seeking to heal the  scars of war the pandemic poses more  challenges to a government that's  already struggling with shortage of  ventilators masks and hand sanitizers  hash Mahabharat al Jazeera
 

